{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"hechang-e-ae1395516f46fc6e38a8","title":"刘肇索谷沐并欲收被诏收后减死髡决复吏","accounts":[{"id":"hechang-a-ae1395516f46fc6e38a8","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"刘肇索谷沐并欲收被诏收后减死髡决复吏","evidence":["hechang-q-643788f41303acba7ee4"]}],"participants":[{"person":"hechang-p-10db289aef81db","role":"索谷告状","evidence":["hechang-q-643788f41303acba7ee4"]},{"person":"hechang-p-c3da0c6a7d3bed","role":"欲收校事被收减死","evidence":["hechang-q-643788f41303acba7ee4"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["hechang-q-643788f41303acba7ee4"]},"ordering_evidence":"hechang-q-643788f41303acba7ee4","order":4719}],"persons":[{"id":"hechang-p-10db289aef81db","name":"刘肇（魏校事）","evidence":["hechang-q-643788f41303acba7ee4"],"facts":[],"mentions":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hechang-q-643788f41303acba7ee4","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-24fb367b2ff6d258bbff","layer":"pei","quote":"校事刘肇出过县，遣人呼县吏，求索稿谷。是时蝗旱，官无有现。未办之间，肇人从，入并之阁下，呴呼骂吏。并怒，因`履提刀而出，多从吏卒，欲收肇。肇觉知，驱走，具以状闻。有诏：‘肇为牧司爪牙吏，而并欲收缚，无所忌惮，自恃清名邪？’遂收，欲杀之；肇，髡。决，减死。刑竟复吏，由是放散十余年。","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":142,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-49639b91fe1a19fa430b","start":75,"end":215,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
